cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "opentool-watch"
abstract: >-
  Topic-agnostic monthly discovery of research papers from OpenAlex, with a pre-screen for
  released code or model weights, flags for likely reviews and preprint/published duplicates,
  a review queue and an offline dashboard. Includes low-dose chest CT (lung cancer screening
  and incidental findings) as a use case.
authors:
  - family-names: "De Luca"
    given-names: "Giulia Raffaella"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/giurdeluca/opentool-watch"
keywords:
  - OpenAlex
  - literature monitoring
  - open source
  - code availability
  - reproducibility
  - medical imaging
  - lung cancer screening
references:
